验收标准.\n\nLet me now write the rick-spec.md comprehensively.\n\nLet me draft the content carefully. I'll write in Chinese (matching project style) but include the required English keywords.\n\nStructure:\n\n```\n# rick-spec — rick 的工程实现契约（四层架构 + 5 模块 + env 四职责）\n\n> 本文档是 rick 项目的第一份 spec 实例，按 `.rick/domain/spec.md` 四要素模板填写。... 依据 RFC ...\n> 定位：task3~11 重构的契约；信息内核。\n\n## 1. 模块边界\n### 1.1 四层架构图\n（mermaid + text）\n### 1.2 分层定义\n### 1.3 边界规则（逐级往下 + 四个例外）\n### 1.4 删除清单\n\n## 2. 职责\n### 2.1 cli\n### 2.2 handler\n### 2.3 env（四职责）\n### 2.4 builder（三件）\n### 2.5 runtime\n\n## 3. 接口契约\n### 3.1 注入模型（三层分离）\n### 3.2 runtime 契约\n### 3.3 builder 契约\n### 3.4 handler 编排顺序\n### 3.5 扩展 seam\n\n## 4. 验收标准\n### 4.1 功能等价\n### 4.2 下沉策略判据\n### 4.3 单一 runtime 判据\n### 4.4 可操作判据\n```\n\nWait — the four-element order from spec.md is: 模块边界 / 职责 / 接口契约 / 验收标准. Good.\n\nLet me make sure the four-layer diagram includes all keywords: 第一层 第二层 第三层 第四层 CLI TUI WEB-UI.\n\nLet me write the mermaid diagram and a text diagram.\n\nMermaid:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[\"第一层 入口\"]\n        CLI\n        TUI\n        WEB-UI\n    end\n    subgraph L2[\"第二层 调度聚合\"]\n        handler\n    end\n    subgraph L3[\"第三层 执行\"]\n        env\n        runtime\n        builder\n    end\n    subgraph L4[\"第四层 基础设施\"]\n        pi\n        dsh\n        workspace\n        config\n    end\n    CLI --> handler\n    TUI --> handler\n    WEB-UI --> handler\n    handler --> env\n    handler --> runtime\n    handler --> builder\n    env --> pi\n    runtime --> pi\n    builder --> pi\n    env --> dsh\n    runtime --> dsh\n    builder --> dsh\n    env <--> dsh\n    TUI --> pi\n    TUI --> dsh\n    WEB-UI --> pi\n    WEB-UI --> dsh\n```\n\nHmm but the exception two says TUI/WEB-UI cross-layer direct connect to pi/dsh (bypassing handler/env/runtime/builder). So they should directly link to pi/dsh.\n\nException one: env ↔ dsh mutual call. Note the task says \"不单列 dshRuntime/dshBuilder 节点，链接直接连到具体组件 env 与 dsh\". So in the di