h/workspace/config. Then exceptions. Good.\n\nNow let me write the text diagram too, to be safe (mermaid might not render but the text is what grep checks; both fine).\n\nLet me write the full document now.\n\nKey content details:\n\nenv 四职责 (four responsibilities):\n① 安装/更新 pi agent\n② 安装/更新 pi 生态扩展/插件/skill\n③ 安装/更新 rick 自有 hook/skill/agent 定制\n④ 提供 pi 功能点就绪 check 函数（不含 session）\n\nbuilder 三件: templates / pibuilder / xxxxbuilder\n\nruntime 职责: 拉起 pi + 内部校验 session 就绪 + 采集行为轨迹 + 返回 (sessionID, trace)\n\nhandler 职责: 编排 env→builder→runtime + 持久化 sessionID 到 job 目录\n\ncli 职责: 路由命令、解析参数、交互呈现（CLI/TUI/WEB-UI 三入口）\n\n注入模型 (injection model): 方法(system prompt) + 技能(skills) + 实例(user prompt) 三层分离:\n- 方法走 --append-system-prompt（保留 pi 默认骨架）\n- 技能走 pi skills 机制\n- 实例走 prompt 文件\n\n下沉策略:\n- dag 调度 → pi workflowScript 编排（await 顺序）\n- 门禁 → pi hook（rick-gates 扩展）+ 确定性脚本\n- think/research/exporter → pi agent（env 职责 3 落盘）\n\n扩展 seam:\n- RuntimeBuilder（builder/xxxxbuilder 转义层）\n- Runtime（runtime，Name/Run）\n- RuntimeEnv（env，Ensure/DeployCustomizations/CheckReady）\n- config runtime 字段（默认 pi）\n- 「新增 dsh 只新增 dshBuilder/dshRuntime/dshEnv 三个实现并注册，cli/handler/方法层 templates 不改」\n\n删除清单: executor（调度→pi）、parser（读/校验→pi）、actpath（轨迹→runtime）、logging（死代码）、git（→pi 脚本）、agent 接口（失去消费者）\n\nNow let me write the file. I'll write comprehensive, accurate content.\n\nLet me be careful about the four-element structure. I'll write:\n\n```\n# rick-spec — rick 工程实现契约\n\n> ...metadata / intro...\n\n## 1. 模块边界\n## 2. 职责\n## 3. 接口契约\n## 4. 验收标准\n```\n\nI need to ensure the keywords all hit. Let me list them:\n- cli ✓ (will appear in section 2.1 and diagram)\n- handler ✓\n- env ✓\n- builder ✓\n- runtime ✓ (lowercase; will appear many times)\n- 安装 ✓ (env four responsibilities)\n- 生态扩展 ✓\n- 定制 ✓\n- 就绪 ✓\n- 第一层 ✓\n- 第二层 ✓\n- 第三层 ✓\n- 第四层 ✓\n- CLI ✓ (uppercase)\n- TUI ✓\n- WEB-UI ✓\n- dag ✓ (lowercase)\n- 门禁 ✓\n- sessionID ✓\n- RuntimeBuilder ✓\n- RuntimeEnv ✓\n- runtime ✓\n\nAnd no `{{`.\n\nNow let me write it. I'll 